Package: homelab-node-exporter
Architecture: all
Depends: prometheus-node-exporter
Recommends: homelab-agent
Description: Fleet host-metrics exporter (Prometheus node_exporter) for homelab-*
 Thin wrapper that deploys the Ubuntu-archive prometheus-node-exporter to
 every homelab-* fleet host and advertises it into the fleet topology via
 an /etc/homelab/services/node-exporter.yml manifest (kind:
 metrics-exporter, port 9100). node_exporter exposes host CPU, load,
 memory, disk, filesystem/tmpfs and network metrics that the monitoring
 host's Prometheus scrapes. No configuration and no secrets -- install it
 on every host; homelab-prometheus discovers and scrapes each host's :9100.
